The '''Spurs of Celanon''' was a [[hyperspace route]] in the [[Outer Rim Territories]] that connected to the [[planet]] [[Serenno]].<ref name="BMF 70" /> The route shared its name with the astronomical object [[Celanon]], located in the [[Outer Rim Territories]].<ref name="TFABG">[[Star Wars: The Force Awakens Beginner Game|''Star Wars: The Force Awakens'' Beginner Game]]</ref>

